18:Tfab,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@graph":[{"@type":["Article","BlogPosting"],"@id":"https://kota.co.uk/blog/best-of-2021-our-projects-and-awards/#article","isPartOf":{"@id":"https://kota.co.uk/blog/best-of-2021-our-projects-and-awards/"},"author":{"name":"KOTA","@id":"https://kota.co.uk/#/schema/person/0920247d2c12a3b934d2bf67a73d97a2"},"headline":"Best of 2021: Our projects and awards.","datePublished":"2021-12-20T09:25:53+00:00","dateModified":"2024-02-29T15:27:09+00:00","mainEntityOfPage":{"@id":"https://kota.co.uk/blog/best-of-2021-our-projects-and-awards/"},"wordCount":6,"publisher":{"@id":"https://kota.co.uk/#organization"},"image":{"@id":"https://kota.co.uk/blog/best-of-2021-our-projects-and-awards/#primaryimage"},"thumbnailUrl":"https://kota.co.uk/app/uploads/2024/02/best-of-2021_.jpg","articleSection":["Culture","Our work"],"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https://kota.co.uk/blog/best-of-2021-our-projects-and-awards/","url":"https://kota.co.uk/blog/best-of-2021-our-projects-and-awards/","name":"Best of 2021: Our projects and awards. - KOTA","isPartOf":{"@id":"https://kota.co.uk/#website"},"primaryImageOfPage":{"@id":"https://kota.co.uk/blog/best-of-2021-our-projects-and-awards/#primaryimage"},"image":{"@id":"https://kota.co.uk/blog/best-of-2021-our-projects-and-awards/#primaryimage"},"thumbnailUrl":"https://kota.co.uk/app/uploads/2024/02/best-of-2021_.jpg","datePublished":"2021-12-20T09:25:53+00:00","dateModified":"2024-02-29T15:27:09+00:00","description":"Celebrating being voted one of the Global 1000 Companies by Clutch and a top UK B2B Creative & Design firm. Join us as we look back at 2021.","breadcrumb":{"@id":"https://kota.co.uk/blog/best-of-2021-our-projects-and-awards/#breadcrumb"},"inLanguage":"en-US","potentialAction":[{"@type":"ReadAction","target":["https://kota.co.uk/blog/best-of-2021-our-projects-and-awards/"]}]},{"@type":"ImageObject","inLanguage":"en-US","@id":"https://kota.co.uk/blog/best-of-2021-our-projects-and-awards/#primaryimage","url":"https://kota.co.uk/app/uploads/2024/02/best-of-2021_.jpg","contentUrl":"https://kota.co.uk/app/uploads/2024/02/best-of-2021_.jpg","width":2239,"height":1249},{"@type":"BreadcrumbList","@id":"https://kota.co.uk/blog/best-of-2021-our-projects-and-awards/#breadcrumb","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Home","item":"https://kota.co.uk/"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"Best of 2021: Our projects and awards."}]},{"@type":"WebSite","@id":"https://kota.co.uk/#website","url":"https://kota.co.uk/","name":"KOTA","description":"","publisher":{"@id":"https://kota.co.uk/#organization"},"potentialAction":[{"@type":"SearchAction","target":{"@type":"EntryPoint","urlTemplate":"https://kota.co.uk/?s={search_term_string}"},"query-input":{"@type":"PropertyValueSpecification","valueRequired":true,"valueName":"search_term_string"}}],"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Organization","@id":"https://kota.co.uk/#organization","name":"KOTA","alternateName":"KOTA creative","url":"https://kota.co.uk/","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","inLanguage":"en-US","@id":"https://kota.co.uk/#/schema/logo/image/","url":"https://kota.co.uk/app/uploads/2024/11/Logo-Profile.png","contentUrl":"https://kota.co.uk/app/uploads/2024/11/Logo-Profile.png","width":1080,"height":1080,"caption":"KOTA"},"image":{"@id":"https://kota.co.uk/#/schema/logo/image/"},"sameAs":["https://www.facebook.com/kotacreative/","https://x.com/kotacreative"]},{"@type":"Person","@id":"https://kota.co.uk/#/schema/person/0920247d2c12a3b934d2bf67a73d97a2","name":"KOTA","image":{"@type":"ImageObject","inLanguage":"en-US","@id":"https://kota.co.uk/#/schema/person/image/","url":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/997a25aeeb59c30e7b958976b63b4e9a84a8addc4e811d9c09e6a924a059c98e?s=96&d=mm&r=g","contentUrl":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/997a25aeeb59c30e7b958976b63b4e9a84a8addc4e811d9c09e6a924a059c98e?s=96&d=mm&r=g","caption":"KOTA"},"sameAs":["https://kota.co.uk/wp"],"url":"https://kota.co.uk/author/kota/"}]}1e:T795,<h2><span style="font-weight: 400;">Introduction.</span></h2>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">2021 is coming to an end so it’s time to wrap it all up and look back at our achievements. The latest one? We were named as one of the </span><a href="https://clutch.co/press-releases/clutch-1000-2021-report" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Global 1000 Companies by Clutch</span></a><span style="font-weight: 400;">! Earlier this year we also made it to </span><a href="https://clutch.co/press-releases/celebrates-highest-ranking-b2b-companies-united-kingdom-2021" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Top B2B Companies in the UK</span></a><span style="font-weight: 400;"> in the Creative &amp; Design category. Big thanks to Clutch and all of our clients who recommended working with us.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Check out our favourite projects of 2021!</span></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<h2><a href="https://kota.co.uk/work/bounce" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Bounce Ping Pong</span></a></h2>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">We designed a new website for Bounce who are Europe&#8217;s largest purpose-built social ping pong club. We translated the venue’s fun vibe into a playful digital experience. Our team can attest &#8211; it’s a great place for social gatherings!</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">This website received <a href="https://www.awwwards.com/sites/bounce-ping-pong" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Honorable Mention from AWWWARDS</a>, <a href="https://www.cssdesignawards.com/sites/bounce-ping-pong/39434/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Special Kudos from CSS Design Awards</a> and was shortlisted for <a href="https://www.restaurantinnovator.com/events/awards" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Restaurant Marketer &amp; Innovator Award</a> in the Best New Website category.</span></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
1f:T4e9,<p><a href="https://kota.co.uk/work/bounce" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Read our case study here.</span></a></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<h2><a href="https://kota.co.uk/work/aardvark" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Aardvark</span></a></h2>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Did you know that pets are responsible for as much as a quarter of the damage associated with the meat industry?</span><span style="font-weight: 400;"> That’s why Aardvark’s mission is to make pet ownership more planet-friendly, by developing food for dogs and cats that uses insects as protein.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Our approach started with streamlining the online shopping experience, making sure the user flow on the site was intuitive to customers, with clearly labelled call-to-actions throughout.</span><span style="font-weight: 400;"> </span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">This website received <a href="https://www.awwwards.com/sites/aardvark" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Honorable Mention from AWWWARDS</a> and <a href="https://www.cssdesignawards.com/sites/aardvark/39091/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Special Kudos from CSS Design Awards</a>.</span></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
20:T5b7,<p><a href="https://kota.co.uk/work/love-brands" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Read our case study here.</span></a></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<h2><a href="https://kota.co.uk/work/littles-coffee" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Little&#8217;s Coffee</span></a></h2>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">We sure do love our coffee here at KOTA, so when Little&#8217;s Coffee reached out to redesign their website we couldn’t say no! They are a family run business filled with a team full of true caffeine lovers. Their journey started 25 years ago and since then, they have been taking flavoured instant coffee to the next level. As of today, you can find them in some of the UK’s biggest supermarkets.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">We designed a fun and frictionless E-commerce website that matches their playful branding and packaging. By implementing features such as customer reviews, product recommendations and mix&amp;match functionality, we were able to significantly improve the purchasing process.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">The website for Little’s received <a href="https://www.awwwards.com/sites/littles-coffee-co" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Honorable Mention from AWWWARDS</a> and <a href="https://www.cssdesignawards.com/sites/littles-coffee-co/39686/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Special Kudos from CSS Design Awards</a>.</span></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
21:T4a6,<p><a href="https://kota.co.uk/work/littles-coffee" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Read our case study here.</span></a></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<h2><a href="https://kota.co.uk/work/tangerine" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span style="font-weight: 400;">tangerine</span></a></h2>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">tangerine are a global design consultancy with studios in London and Seoul. They specialise in designing compelling customer experiences across products and services for globally renowned brands, including British Airways, Samsung and Hyundai.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">The goal of the project was to create a thoughtful, intuitive and inspiring website which supports their new projects, brand values and messaging. We made sure tangerine stands out from their competitors!</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">This website received <a href="https://www.awwwards.com/sites/tangerine" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Honorable Mention from AWWWARDS</a> and <a href="https://www.cssdesignawards.com/sites/tangerine/40239/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Special Kudos from CSS Design Awards</a>.</span></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
