ands\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">LoveBrands</span></a></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Love Brands are a unique fashion distribution and retail consultancy based in Wapping, East London. They have exclusive rights to distribute well-known fashion labels in the UK and Ireland, including GUESS, JOOP!, and Kendall + Kylie.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">We gave the company a complete rebrand, including a new visual identity, website, brand video and photoshoot for their tenth year of trading. The branding and visual identity consisted of a new logo and icon mark, typography, new graphic elements, and a stand out colour palette. Now, it perfectly reflects Love Brands and the services they offer.</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n"}}]}]}]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"FullWidthMedia_fullWidthMedia__NRjkh","children":["$","$L1c",null,{"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","figure",null,{"className":"FullWidthMedia_image__yCr3O","data-width":"contained","children":[["$","$L1b",null,{"image":{"altText":"","srcSet":"https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2024/02/Case-Study-1-1-1400x813.jpg 1400w, https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2024/02/Case-Study-1-1-2000x1161.jpg 2000w, https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2024/02/Case-Study-1-1-500x290.jpg 500w, https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2024/02/Case-Study-1-1-768x446.jpg 768w, https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2024/02/Case-Study-1-1-1536x892.jpg 1536w, https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2024/02/Case-Study-1-1-2048x1189.jpg 2048w","sourceUrl":"https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2024/02/Case-Study-1-1.jpg","mediaDetails":{"width":2360,"height":1370}},"layout":"intrinsic"}],null]}],false]}]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"Text_text__jOaGN","children":["$","$L1d",null,{"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"Text_textInn